/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Oh I see.  I thought you were suggesting I move _get_default_debug_color into ``DEBUG_ENABLED``.  I'm actually a fan of doing this as the constructor for CollisionShape2D and CollisionShape3D would no longer need to execute:\r\n\r\n```\r\ndebug_color = _get_default_debug_color();\r\n```\r\n\r\nI expect the runtime overhead is negligeable for the most part.  But if users are spawning \"mobs\" / millions of colliders, constantly calling ``_get_default_debug_color`` may start to add some unnecessary overhead on release builds.\r\n\r\nSo it does make sense to limit this to debug builds.","created_at":"2024-12-23T19:59:09Z","updated_at":"2024-12-23T19:59:57Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100317#discussion_r1896082817","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100317","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1896082817"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100317#discussion_r1896082817"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100317"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1896082817/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":49,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":51,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1896044913,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":9,"po